    "sections": {
        "description": "The Aster Real Estate theme is a modern, professional, and multipurpose solution designed for real estate agencies, property dealers, realtors, brokers, housing consultants, property management companies, rental services, and real estate developers. With a clean, elegant, and fully responsive layout, it ensures a seamless user experience across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. The theme includes dedicated sections for property listings, featured properties, agent profiles, client testimonials, interactive banners, and strategically placed Call to Action (CTA) buttons to drive inquiries and leads. Built with optimized and secure code, it offers easy customization of colors, fonts, and layouts to reflect your brand identity. Fully compatible with WooCommerce for property sales or bookings and Contact Form 7 for inquiries, the Aster Real Estate theme provides a professional, SEO-friendly, and high-performing platform to showcase properties, attract potential buyers or tenants, and grow your real estate business online."
    },
